{:strongs 2563, :hebrew "חמר", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, a bubbling up, i.e. of water, a wave; of earth, mire or clay (cement); also a heap; hence, a chomer or dry measure", :text "本义为 bubbling up，即：指水时，波浪；指泥土时，淤泥或黏土（胶泥）；亦指一堆；引申为 chomer（干量度量单位）", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:23:50.551872432Z"}